<title>USA: EUGENE, ORE., WON BY DAIN BOSWORTH.</title>
<headline>EUGENE, ORE., WON BY DAIN BOSWORTH.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc said in won $7 million of Eugene, Ore., Broadway garages taxable limited tax bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 7.08 percent.</p>
</text>
